      "body": "SIS Limited (NSEI:SIS) acquired 4.20% stake in Updater Services Limited (NSEI:UDS) for approximately INR 510 million on June 5, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 513.9 million will be paid by SIS Limited. As part of consideration, INR 513.9 million is paid towards common equity of Updater Services Limited. The acquisition of shares forms part of the Company's ongoing treasury management operations.\n\nSIS Limited (NSEI:SIS) completed the acquisition of 4.20% stake in Updater Services Limited (NSEI:UDS) on June 5, 2026.",
